# Options Open Interest Dashboard

Live at [options.pranavp.dev](https://options.pranavp.dev). Runs every weekday at 4:30 PM ET via GitHub Actions, fetches options chain data for ~130 US tech stocks, and publishes an interactive HTML dashboard to GitHub Pages.

## Module Map

| File | Role |
|---|---|
| `main.py` | Entry point — orchestrates fetch → analyze → export, writes Excel + HTML, manages JSON snapshots |
| `universe.py` | Ticker lists: `SP500_IT`, `NASDAQ_100` (active), `INDIA_FNO` (defined but excluded — needs broker API) |
| `fetcher.py` | yfinance wrapper: price, 1D/5D price history, earnings date, company info. Calls NASDAQ API first, falls back to yfinance for options chain |
| `nasdaq_fetcher.py` | NASDAQ public API (`api.nasdaq.com/api/quote/{ticker}/option-chain`) — free, no key, returns all expiries × all strikes with accurate OI + bid/ask. Uses `requests`, NOT yfinance/curl_cffi |
| `analyzer.py` | All signal logic: classify BUY/SELL/HEDGE-C/HEDGE-P, compute Max Pain, PCR, Implied Move, OI trends, signal flips, intra-week expiries |
| `exporter_html.py` | Generates self-contained ~3000-line HTML dashboard (Chart.js from CDN, all data embedded as JSON) |

## The 8 Horizons

```python
HORIZONS = {"fri": None, "7d": 7, "30d": 30, "45d": 45, "60d": 60, "90d": 90, "180d": 180, "1y": 365}
```

- `"fri"` → next Friday that hasn't expired (special case, not a day count)
- `"30d"`–`"90d"` → OI trend compared vs 7-day-old snapshot (`prev_data_weekly`)
- `"fri"`/`"7d"` → OI trend compared vs yesterday's snapshot (`prev_data`)
- `"180d"`/`"1y"` → suppressed (totals shown only, no trend %)

## Signal Taxonomy

| Signal | Condition |
|---|---|
| `BUY` | OTM Call (strike ≥ price) |
| `SELL` | OTM Put (strike ≤ price) |
| `HEDGE-C` | ITM Call (strike < price) |
| `HEDGE-P` | ITM Put (strike > price) |

OI Trend combo signals: Build-Up, Unwinding, Bullish, Bearish, Hedged Rally, Short Covering.
Threshold: ≥5% AND ≥500 contracts absolute change.

